There's a spoiler I just discovered about identifying gems.
(It is not the "You engrave with the polka-dotted gem." spoiler...)

You feel spoiled!


Engraving with glass and your fingers takes one turn.  (No matter how much
you write.)

Engraving with gems, regardless of the "write" vs. "engrave" message, takes
one turn per letter.

So, to identify gems, simply engrave a long string, and notice how much the
monsters move around you.  (Or better yet, notice the time counter in your
status line, if available.)

